#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A private message keeps that user list too: it shows the two of you under Participants, with a dot saying whether the other person is online, away or not connected. Right-click them there for Whois, Ignore, Add to Contacts and a P2P session."
msgstr "A private message keeps that user list too: it shows the two of you under Participants, with a dot saying whether the other person is online, away or not connected. Right-click them there for Whois, Ignore, Add to Contacts and a P2P session."

